╭─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│  Search Mode Help                                                                                           │
│─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
│                                                                                                             │
│  Navigation                   Actions                      General                                          │
│  h          focus results     enter      open tree view    ctrl+space switch mode                           │
│  l          focus details     y          copy issue ID     ?          toggle help                           │
│  k/↑        move up           ctrl+s     save to view      q          quit                                  │
│  j/↓        move down         ctrl+e     edit issue                                                         │
│  /          focus search      ctrl+d     delete issue                                                       │
│  esc        exit to kanban                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                             │
│  BQL Fields                                                              BQL Operators                      │
│  status              open, in_progress, blocked, deferred, closed,       =  !=       equality               │
│                      pinned, hooked, custom                              <  >        comparison             │
│  type                bug, feature, task, epic, chore, decision,          ~  !~       contains               │
│                      spike, story, milestone, custom                     in          match any: in (a, b)   │
│  priority            p0, p1, p2, p3, p4                                  and or      logical                │
│  blocked             true, false                                         expand      up, down, all          │
│  ready               true, false                                         depth       1-10 or * (unlimited)  │
│  pinned              true, false                                         not         negation               │
│  is_template         true, false                                                                            │
│  label               string (~ for contains)                                                                │
│  title               string (~ for contains)                                                                │
│  description         string (use ~ for contains)                                                            │
│  design              string (use ~ for contains)                                                            │
│  notes               string (use ~ for contains)                                                            │
│  acceptance_criteria string (~ for contains)                                                                │
│  close_reason        string (~ for contains)                                                                │
│  id                  string                                                                                 │
│  assignee            string                                                                                 │
│  owner               string                                                                                 │
│  sender              string                                                                                 │
│  created_by          string                                                                                 │
│  mol_type            string                                                                                 │
│  created             today, -7d                                                                             │
│  updated             today, -7d                                                                             │
│  started             today, -7d                                                                             │
│  closed              today, -7d                                                                             │
│  due                 today, -7d                                                                             │
│  defer_until         date (now, today, yesterday, -7d)                                                      │
│                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                             │
│  Examples                                                                                                   │
│  status = open and ready = true                                                                             │
│  type in (bug, task) and status != closed                                                                   │
│  status = open and defer_until > now                                                                        │
│  created >= -7d order by priority                                                                           │
│  type = epic expand down                                                                                    │
│                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                             │
│  Press ? or Esc to close                                                                                    │
╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯